p you;<br>- Spaceship select / characters;<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165820/extras/ae4bc381dfffb9e30602003148d65a1f.poster.avif?t=1666983663\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165820/extras/ae4bc381dfffb9e30602003148d65a1f.webm?t=1666983663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1165820/extras/ae4bc381dfffb9e30602003148d65a1f.mp4?t=1666983663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
